3,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope bullet 'separate Gerrit advisory workflow' + AC '_scanner-integration.yml carries the b973 predates guard'","norm_id":"nfe09e476907c091b","priority":0.1833,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An open change whose base predates the scanner script is dispatched -> gerrit-scanner-verify.yml runs install_review_scanners.py -> No such file -> advisory job errors on every such patchset until rebased"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add an if-present guard on scripts/install_review_scanners.py (and make target) in gerrit-scanner-verify.yml that skips with the canonical 'change predates the gate' message, and add gerrit-scanner-verify.yml to the guarded/derived surface (or root the closure at it) so the parity test enforces the guard.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5556,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"insufficient","asserted_capability_confirmed":"insufficient","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"insufficient","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}},{"block_threshold":0.8,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Require gerrit-scanner-verify.yml to declare the nine GERRIT_* workflow_dispatch inputs (matching gerrit-verify.yaml / jira-dc-exact-patchset.yml) so gerrit-to-platform's filename-selected dispatch actually resolves and runs the advisory lane.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.668,"drop_reason":"novelty","evidence":["gerrit_to_platform.ini.template:24-25: 'g2p dispatches via GitHub workflow_dispatch(ref = refs/heads/{GERRIT_BRANCH})' with inputs","jira-dc-exact-patchset.yml:30-40 declares all nine GERRIT_* workflow_dispatch inputs precisely because it is dispatched 'the SAME way gerrit-verify.yaml is (by gerrit-to-platform ... with the same nine GERRIT_* inputs)'","gerrit-verify.yaml:34-44 declares the nine GERRIT_* inputs","ABSENCE: the plan states the filename must be selected by dispatch but never states the workflow_dispatch input contract required for that dispatch to actually resolve and run"],"finding":"The plan does not require gerrit-scanner-verify.yml to declare the nine GERRIT_* workflow_dispatch inputs that gerrit-to-platform sends, so the auto-dispatch it relies on may fail to resolve and the advisory lane silently never runs.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f318560896d143499","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Scope bullet 'separate Gerrit advisory workflow .github/workflows/gerrit-scanner-verify.yml' + Advisory wiring contract","norm_id":"n0cbad9661d30b670","priority":0.132,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["g2p dispatches gerrit-scanner-verify.yml with nine GERRIT_* inputs it does not declare -> workflow_dispatch fails / inputs unusable -> advisory lane never executes, reproducing the incident's 'never ran' failure mode"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Add to Scope/Advisory-wiring: gerrit-scanner-verify.yml declares the same nine GERRIT_* workflow_dispatch inputs as gerrit-verify.yaml, and fetches the exact patchset via checkout-gerrit-change-action, so g2p's filename-substring dispatch resolves and checks out the patchset under review.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"ye